14年世界杯决赛的失利，对于他来讲还是很遗憾的。他不是贪心，就是觉得很可惜。 那么既然梅西已经有了世界杯冠军，他的足球生涯该有的荣誉都有了，梅西也不是心态不好，想不开的人，可是为何他还是忘不了14年世界杯的决赛失利，这是为何呢"},"attached_info":"CkoIuPT3+sbxxYoQEAMaCTExNDU2ODU0NSCYj4nABjAAOJ4BQBtyEzE4OTY2NjM2OTk4MjI5Nzg3MDR4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"38 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-af4275e2f0df997f0a8adfe5b74893b6_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"28_1745200470.621284","card_id":"Q_1895857491901927551","target":{"id":1895857491901927400,"title":"如何评价电影《名侦探柯南：独眼的残像》（M28）？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1895857491901927551","type":"question","created":1744787649,"answer_count":37,"follower_count":70,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[13908,23041,3122093,3934163],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"北影节要上了，看完首映的朋友们可以来分享一下~"},"attached_info":"CkkIuPT3+sbxxYoQEAMaCTExNDUyODAzOSDBsf2/BjAAOEZAHHITMTg5NTg1NzQ5MTkwMTkyNzU1MXgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"38 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-4e0dbc9d807ecaafce3d657d74fbb480_1440w.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"29_1745200470.621582","card_id":"Q_1891271477241827656","target":{"id":1891271477241827600,"title":"为什么很多天上很有名气的神仙都怕孙悟空，而他们的坐骑或手下的小童一旦下界为妖，却不怕悟空？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1891271477241827656","type":"question","created":1743694258,"answer_count":86,"follower_count":149,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[10867,156312],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkoIuPT3+sbxxYoQEAMaCTExNDMyMDM0NiCy07q/BjAAOJUBQB1yEzE4OTEyNzE0NzcyNDE4Mjc2NTZ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"38 